    "biography": {
      "concept": "Jackalope harbourmaster of Port Kudzu; runs the Fewer Dead Fish Smell Saloon (Act 3)",
      "notes": "Harbourmaster Dot Pellew runs Port Kudzu's berths and, on the side, the Fewer Dead Fish Smell Saloon, a name she will tell you is a promise and a kept one. She is a Jackalope: brisk, funny and hospitable, and she keeps a booking ledger the way Verna Tulliver keeps a guest ledger. Everything that leaves the port is in it. The saloon smells of exactly as many dead fish as advertised."
    }
